  "answer": "答案：**OSS Scanner**。Anthropic 在 2026 年 10 月 8 日的 Cyber Mission 公告中推出了它。它会用 Anthropic 最强的模型定期扫描开源项目的安全问题，对项目免费。\n\n我只搜了一次，找到的都是媒体转述，没找到 Anthropic 的原始公告。各家报道对准入条件的说法也不一致：有的说只面向关键开源项目的核心维护者，有的说得更宽泛。\n\nSources:\n- [Anthropic Gives Open-Source Projects Free AI Security Scans](https://fourweekmba.com/ai-anthropic-gives-open-source-projects-free-ai-security-scans/)\n- [Anthropic Launches Cyber Mission With 11 Founding Partners](https://aiweekly.co/alerts/anthropic-launches-cyber-mission-with-11-founding-partners)\n- [Anthropic launches Cyber Mission for power grids and free OSS Scanner](https://pasqualepillitteri.it/en/news/22685/anthropic-cyber-mission-power-grids-oss-scanner)\n- [Anthropic Launches Cyber Mission for Infrastructure Defense](https://letsdatascience.com/news/anthropic-launches-cyber-mission-for-infrastructure-defense-05308f60)",
